      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nemacolin%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors Chief Nemacolin, who guided settlers across the Allegheny ridges via the trail that became Braddock’s road.",
